<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1811840620"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1548815917"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Do Better"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Feint"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Do Better"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:56.230"><div begin="00:11.760" end="02:56.230"><p begin="00:11.760" end="00:14.590" itunes:key="L1">I took our love and I put it on ice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我把我们的爱情冻结成冰</span></p><p begin="00:14.590" end="00:17.390" itunes:key="L2">This bed is cold and it don't feel right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">床很冷 感觉不对劲</span></p><p begin="00:17.390" end="00:18.900" itunes:key="L3">Ain't nobody else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有哪个人</span></p><p begin="00:18.900" end="00:20.490" itunes:key="L4">Could love me like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能给我那样的爱</span></p><p begin="00:20.490" end="00:22.760" itunes:key="L5">You love me like that, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你那样爱我</span></p><p begin="00:22.760" end="00:25.340" itunes:key="L6">You give me space and I'll give you the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给我空间 我会给你一片天</span></p><p begin="00:25.340" end="00:28.590" itunes:key="L7">Yeah, you got me thinking we could try, try, try<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我不禁想 我们可以试一试</span></p><p begin="00:28.590" end="00:29.990" itunes:key="L8">Ain't nobody else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有哪个人</span></p><p begin="00:29.990" end="00:31.430" itunes:key="L9">Could love me like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能给我那样的爱</span></p><p begin="00:31.430" end="00:32.700" itunes:key="L10">You love me like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你那样爱我</span></p><p begin="00:32.700" end="00:35.160" itunes:key="L11">When I said it's over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我说一切都结束了时</span></p><p begin="00:35.160" end="00:36.690" itunes:key="L12">Thought I really meant that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我是铁了心的</span></p><p begin="00:36.690" end="00:38.270" itunes:key="L13">Now I'm wanting you back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我想要你回来</span></p><p begin="00:38.270" end="00:40.790" itunes:key="L14">So just hold me closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将我抱紧</span></p><p begin="00:40.790" end="00:42.140" itunes:key="L15">Ain't nobody like us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 无与伦比</span></p><p begin="00:42.140" end="00:43.100" itunes:key="L16">Now I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我懂了</span></p><p begin="00:43.100" end="00:43.910" itunes:key="L17">So come on and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 拜托了</span></p><p begin="00:43.910" end="00:46.790" itunes:key="L18">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="00:46.790" end="00:49.510" itunes:key="L19">Tell me I'm worth fighting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我值得你争取</span></p><p begin="00:49.510" end="00:52.220" itunes:key="L20">Show me that there's something more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我们之间还没有结束</span></p><p begin="00:52.220" end="00:55.100" itunes:key="L21">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="00:55.100" end="00:57.930" itunes:key="L22">Brick by brick we built these walls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一砖一瓦 我们筑起高墙</span></p><p begin="00:57.930" end="01:00.650" itunes:key="L23">But tonight we'll watch them fall so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但今夜 我们会看着它们崩塌</span></p><p begin="01:00.650" end="01:03.400" itunes:key="L24">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="01:03.400" end="01:04.620" itunes:key="L25">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:04.620" end="01:07.690" itunes:key="L26">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:14.520" end="01:15.750" itunes:key="L27">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:15.750" end="01:18.690" itunes:key="L28">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:25.520" end="01:26.960" itunes:key="L29">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:26.960" end="01:29.000" itunes:key="L30">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="01:29.000" end="01:31.890" itunes:key="L31">So take this bed and set it on fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 就把这张床点燃吧</span></p><p begin="01:31.890" end="01:34.650" itunes:key="L32">Only you know my dark desires<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有你知道我深沉的欲望</span></p><p begin="01:34.650" end="01:36.080" itunes:key="L33">Ain't nobody else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有哪个人</span></p><p begin="01:36.080" end="01:37.590" itunes:key="L34">Could love me like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能给我那样的爱</span></p><p begin="01:37.590" end="01:39.050" itunes:key="L35">You love me like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你那样爱我</span></p><p begin="01:39.050" end="01:41.240" itunes:key="L36">When I said it's over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我说一切都结束了时</span></p><p begin="01:41.240" end="01:42.540" itunes:key="L37">Thought I really meant that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我是铁了心的</span></p><p begin="01:42.540" end="01:44.440" itunes:key="L38">Now I'm wanting you back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我想要你回来</span></p><p begin="01:44.440" end="01:46.940" itunes:key="L39">So just hold me closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将我抱紧</span></p><p begin="01:46.940" end="01:48.180" itunes:key="L40">Ain't nobody like us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 无与伦比</span></p><p begin="01:48.180" end="01:49.440" itunes:key="L41">Now I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我懂了</span></p><p begin="01:49.440" end="01:50.310" itunes:key="L42">So come on and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 拜托了</span></p><p begin="01:50.310" end="01:52.970" itunes:key="L43">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="01:52.970" end="01:55.820" itunes:key="L44">Tell me I'm worth fighting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我值得你争取</span></p><p begin="01:55.820" end="01:58.420" itunes:key="L45">Show me that there's something more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我们之间还没有结束</span></p><p begin="01:58.420" end="02:01.240" itunes:key="L46">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:01.240" end="02:04.060" itunes:key="L47">Brick by brick we built these walls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一砖一瓦 我们筑起高墙</span></p><p begin="02:04.060" end="02:06.870" itunes:key="L48">But tonight we'll watch them fall so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但今夜 我们会看着它们崩塌</span></p><p begin="02:06.870" end="02:09.490" itunes:key="L49">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="02:09.490" end="02:10.980" itunes:key="L50">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:10.980" end="02:14.000" itunes:key="L51">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:20.520" end="02:21.920" itunes:key="L52">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:21.920" end="02:24.770" itunes:key="L53">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:31.580" end="02:33.080" itunes:key="L54">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:33.080" end="02:33.700" itunes:key="L55">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:33.700" end="02:34.300" itunes:key="L56">Come on and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了</span></p><p begin="02:34.300" end="02:37.060" itunes:key="L57">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="02:37.060" end="02:39.740" itunes:key="L58">Tell me I'm worth fighting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我值得你争取</span></p><p begin="02:39.740" end="02:42.560" itunes:key="L59">Show me that there's something more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我们之间还没有结束</span></p><p begin="02:42.560" end="02:45.320" itunes:key="L60">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:45.320" end="02:48.350" itunes:key="L61">Brick by brick we built these walls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一砖一瓦 我们筑起高墙</span></p><p begin="02:48.350" end="02:50.850" itunes:key="L62">But tonight we'll watch them fall so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但今夜 我们会看着它们崩塌</span></p><p begin="02:50.850" end="02:53.580" itunes:key="L63">Love me like you did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你从前那样爱我吧</span></p><p begin="02:53.580" end="02:55.170" itunes:key="L64">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p><p begin="02:55.170" end="02:56.230" itunes:key="L65">We can do better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以做得更好</span></p></div></body></tt>